        347,
        811,
        1066,
        999
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "b. No contracting agency shall enter into any contract with or award any contract to any bidder or prospective contractor subject to the foregoing requirement unless the bidder or prospective contractor has, prior to such award, submitted a program of affirmative action acceptable to the City Administrator, or, if the City Administrator so authorizes by rule, regulation or order, to the contracting agency.",
