      "text": "c. In the event that dispute arises between the bidder or prospective contractor and the contracting agency, or the City Administrator, as to whether the proposed program of affirmative action for providing equal employment opportunity submitted by such bidder or prospective contractor complies with such requirements, then the matter shall forthwith be referred to the Board of Responsibility of The City of New York for hearing and determination. The determination of such Board shall be final and conclusive, subject only to judicial review.",
